            "review_title": "Review at Lach Ca Lach Cach The Loop Xuan Thuy",
            "review_text": "Hani\nItaewon, South Korea15 contributions\n0\nAn amazing Vietnamese cuisine experience as expected\nJan 2025 • Solo\nI passed by twice and found it charming, so I decided to stop in. We went as a pair and ordered about 3-4 dishes, including main courses and some light bites, which felt just right. The prices are mid-range, but in return, you get an elegant space with a cozy Vietnamese home-style vibe.\nWritten March 19, 2025",
            "rating": 4.0,
