            "review_title": "Review at Lach Ca Lach Cach The Loop Xuan Thuy",
            "review_text": "Khemera\nCambodia23 contributions\n0\nCozy and priceable\nMar 2025 • Couples\nThe name of the restaurant is curious, I tried the branch at The Loop & liked the salted egg tofu, a must-try for a fun snack. The staff is very enthusiastic in advising on dishes, the space is cozy, feels like home. It will be cheaper if you go with a large group, the experience is worth the money.\nWritten March 12, 2025",
